---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; import data from '../../../../data/generated/ca-5gc-sim.json';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(value:string)=>`${base}${value.replace(/^\//,'')}`; const driftCount=data.drift.implementationOnlyRoutes.length+data.drift.documentedOnlyRoutes.length; const openApiUrl='https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-5gc-sim/blob/main/schemas/v1alpha1/fivegc-sim.openapi.yaml'; const serverUrl='https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-5gc-sim/blob/main/internal/httpapi/server.go'; const surfaceZh:Record<string,string>={'Diagnostics':'诊断','Owner API':'Owner API','Host control':'Host 控制','Fabric integration':'Fabric 内部集成'};
---
<SiteLayout title="ca-5gc-sim HTTP API" lang="zh"><section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">ca-5gc-sim / HTTP API</span><h1>路由与契约覆盖情况</h1><p class="lede">这里不是只把 OpenAPI 原样贴出来，而是取 OpenAPI 与 Go HTTP 实际注册路由的并集，因此“实现了但还没写进 OpenAPI”的接口也会被直接暴露出来。</p><div class="page-tabs"><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/')}>概览</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/facts/')}>Facts</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/operations/')}>Operations</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/standalone/')}>Standalone</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.documentedRoutes}</strong><span>OpenAPI 路由</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.implementationRoutes}</strong><span>实现路由</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.facts}</strong><span>/v1/facts/read 背后的 Facts</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.operations}</strong><span>/v1/operations 背后的 Operations</span></div></div></section><section class="section">{driftCount>0?<div class="notice">当前存在 {driftCount} 处契约漂移：OpenAPI 与 Server 路由注册并不完全一致。CA Docs 不会默默把这个差异抹平。</div>:<div class="notice good">当前 OpenAPI 与 Server 路由注册完全一致。</div>}<div style="overflow-x:auto; margin-top:1rem"><table><thead><tr><th>方法</th><th>路径</th><th>能力面</th><th>OpenAPI</th><th>Server</th></tr></thead><tbody>{data.routes.map((route)=><tr><td><code>{route.method}</code></td><td><code>{route.path}</code></td><td>{surfaceZh[route.surface]??route.surface}</td><td>{route.documented?'✓':'—'}</td><td>{route.implemented?'✓':'—'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section><section class="section"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>机器 API 的权威来源</h3><p>请求/响应线协议仍以上游 OpenAPI 与 JSON Schema 为准。</p><div class="pills"><a class="pill" href={openApiUrl}>打开 OpenAPI ↗</a></div></div><div class="card"><h3>实现路由检查</h3><p>站点会单独检查 HTTP Server 注册，以便及时发现 OpenAPI 覆盖缺口。</p><div class="pills"><a class="pill" href={serverUrl}>打开 server.go ↗</a></div></div></div></section></SiteLayout>